          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The handoff calls for sustained work on the omitted Jacobi tail. I’ll begin the source-sensitive closure analysis alongside two parallel checks: one of the memory identities and one of the source-score residuals. The inherited coefficient bounds remain useful inputs; zero confinement is still open.\n"
