            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1794811776.537,
          "update_time": 1794811779.865,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "A more suitable leading score term has emerged:\n\\(V_\\lambda'(u)=8\\pi\\sinh(4u)-2\\lambda u+b(u)\\), with bounded \\(b\\). A fixed polynomial leaves a residual of size \\(n+O(\\log^{d+1}n)\\) in the degree-\\(n\\) identity; the exponential term reduces that residual to \\(O(\\log n)\\).\n\nThat improvement is useful, but it is not yet a zero-control mechanism: the control sources can also have small relative score defects.\n"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "metadata": {
            "source": "Codex completed public message",
