          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Both internal assessments accepted the results without mathematical correction. The smooth perturbation check confirms the remaining gap: the next canonical defect can take either sign while the retained data, smooth theta tails, and coefficient envelope stay fixed.\n\nI’m updating the progress register and continuation note so the next pass starts from that result. Zero confinement remains unproved.\n"
            ]
          },
